module lib/hf/tests/jk
  The checks of lib/hf/jk against reference data, and their helpers.

jk_t_bad  @2bf74b5f
  why    A cross-check is only worth something if it catches an error. This
         member plants one, and the test checks that the sweep blames this
         member and the right entry.
  serves [test "a planted exchange error is caught and blamed on its member and entry"]
  X1     the packed integrals
  X2     not read
  X3     not read
  D      the densities
  opts   the options column array
  R      `jk_packed`'s result with one exchange entry moved
